{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-54908","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-105624","text":"BendScript Protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-54909","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105625","text":"A graph-first document format with typed inline link facets, for agent-native systems."}]},{"id":"blk-54910","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105626","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status:"},{"id":"spn-105627","text":" v0.1 draft (sections 0–6). Pre-implementation."}]},{"id":"blk-54911","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-105628","text":"Direction"}]},{"id":"blk-54912","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105629","text":"bendscript.com is being rebuilt as a "},{"id":"spn-105630","marks":["bold"],"text":"protocol spec + reference framework"},{"id":"spn-105631","text":", not a canvas/KAG SaaS. The previous direction (SvelteKit canvas editor + KAG server on Supabase) is archived under "},{"id":"spn-105632","marks":["code"],"text":"old_scrap/v1/"},{"id":"spn-105633","text":" and is not being extended."}]},{"id":"blk-54913","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105634","text":"The new product is:"}]},{"id":"blk-54914","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54916","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105635","text":"A JSON document format ("},{"id":"spn-105636","marks":["code"],"text":"bend:"},{"id":"spn-105637","text":" URI scheme, content-addressable ids, span-addressable graph edges)"}]}],"id":"blk-54915","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54918","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105638","text":"A reference parser/validator/edge-extractor ("},{"id":"spn-105639","marks":["code"],"text":"@bendscript/core"},{"id":"spn-105640","text":", not yet written)"}]}],"id":"blk-54917","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54920","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105641","text":"An LLM round-trip test harness (the load-bearing claim of v0.1)"}]}],"id":"blk-54919","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54922","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105642","text":"Five reserved vocabularies that integrate with the rest of the [&] portfolio"}]}],"id":"blk-54921","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-54923","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-105643","text":"Source-of-truth spec"}]},{"id":"blk-54924","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54926","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105644","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/README.md"},{"id":"spn-105645","text":" — BendScript Protocol v0.1 draft (sections 0–6)"}]}],"id":"blk-54925","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-54927","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-105646","text":"What's archived"}]},{"id":"blk-54928","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105647","marks":["code"],"text":"old_scrap/v1/"},{"id":"spn-105648","text":" contains the entire previous product — SvelteKit app, Supabase migrations integration, AGENTS.md, prompts, the v1.0 canvas-and-KAG spec ("},{"id":"spn-105649","marks":["code"],"text":"old_scrap/v1/docs/spec/README.md"},{"id":"spn-105650","text":"), and all build configs. It is historical; do not extend it."}]},{"id":"blk-54929","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-105651","text":"The landing page is GENERATED. Do not hand-edit "},{"id":"spn-105652","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-105653","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-54930","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105654","marks":["code"],"text":"/index.html"},{"id":"spn-105655","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-105656","marks":["code"],"text":"/graph.js"},{"id":"spn-105657","text":" are emitted by "},{"id":"spn-105658","marks":["code"],"text":"build-site.mjs"},{"id":"spn-105659","text":" from "},{"id":"spn-105660","marks":["code"],"text":"records/surface.json"},{"id":"spn-105661","text":", "},{"id":"spn-105662","marks":["code"],"text":"records/corpus.json"},{"id":"spn-105663","text":", "},{"id":"spn-105664","marks":["code"],"text":"src/landing.html"},{"id":"spn-105665","text":", "},{"id":"spn-105666","marks":["code"],"text":"src/shell.css"},{"id":"spn-105667","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-105668","marks":["code"],"text":"src/graph.js"},{"id":"spn-105669","text":". "},{"id":"spn-105670","marks":["bold"],"text":"An edit to the served HTML is silently reverted by the next build."},{"id":"spn-105671","text":" Change the record or the template."}]},{"id":"blk-54931","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"npm run test:launch   # build the library, run the tests, emit the site, run the gate"},{"id":"blk-54932","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105672","marks":["code"],"text":"launch-gate.mjs"},{"id":"spn-105673","text":" reads the emitted artifact and refuses to publish when it and the records disagree — a retracted claim reinstated, a rung invented, a CTA the rung has not earned, an unrendered token, a "},{"id":"spn-105674","marks":["code"],"text":"mailto:"},{"id":"spn-105675","text":", a text token below 4.5:1, a same-origin link that resolves to nothing, an artifact that is not what its source compiles to, or an identifying-animation constant leaking into the copy. "},{"id":"spn-105676","marks":["bold"],"text":"128 checks."},{"id":"spn-105677","text":" The whole shell is documented in "},{"id":"spn-105678","marks":["code"],"text":"ProjectAmp2/agents/SHELL.md"},{"id":"spn-105679","text":"; this surface is built against revision "},{"id":"spn-105680","marks":["bold"],"text":"`shell-r9`"},{"id":"spn-105681","text":", recorded as "},{"id":"spn-105682","marks":["code"],"text":"shell_revision"},{"id":"spn-105683","text":" in "},{"id":"spn-105684","marks":["code"],"text":"records/surface.json"},{"id":"spn-105685","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-54933","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105686","marks":["bold"],"text":"Do not hand-type a check count anywhere."},{"id":"spn-105687","text":" The gate prints its own total; the number above is the one it printed on 2026-08-17, and it is the only kind of figure on this surface that is not derived. It went 92 → 128 in one session, which is what makes a typed count a liability."}]},{"id":"blk-54934","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105688","text":"Two checks in it are newer than the rest and are the ones to understand first:"}]},{"id":"blk-54935","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54937","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105689","marks":["bold"],"text":"The computed-colour resolver."},{"id":"spn-105690","text":" Every contrast check reads a "},{"id":"spn-105691","marks":["italic"],"text":"declared"}]}],"id":"blk-54936","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-54938","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105692","text":"token, and r7's header-CTA defect — "},{"id":"spn-105693","marks":["code"],"text":".top nav a"},{"id":"spn-105694","text":" (0,2,1) beating "},{"id":"spn-105695","marks":["code"],"text":".btn"},{"id":"spn-105696","text":" (0,1,0), so the button painted "},{"id":"spn-105697","marks":["code"],"text":"--fg2"},{"id":"spn-105698","text":" on the accent at "},{"id":"spn-105699","marks":["bold"],"text":"1.19:1"},{"id":"spn-105700","text":" — passed all of them for as long as it shipped. The gate now resolves the cascade over the emitted artifact (specificity, source order, "},{"id":"spn-105701","marks":["code"],"text":"!important"},{"id":"spn-105702","text":", "},{"id":"spn-105703","marks":["code"],"text":"@media"},{"id":"spn-105704","text":" at 1600/1280/800/390, "},{"id":"spn-105705","marks":["code"],"text":"var()"},{"id":"spn-105706","text":", inheritance) against each "},{"id":"spn-105707","marks":["code"],"text":".btn"},{"id":"spn-105708","text":"'s real ancestor chain, and refuses when a button's colour is decided by a non-button rule. Its verdicts were cross-checked against the browser's own computed styles and agreed on all four buttons. A selector it cannot parse is a REFUSAL, not a skip; finding zero buttons is a REFUSAL too."}]},{"id":"blk-54939","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54941","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105709","marks":["bold"],"text":"The correction form's shape"},{"id":"spn-105710","text":" (SHELL.md r9): the "},{"id":"spn-105711","marks":["code"],"text":"action"},{"id":"spn-105712","text":" must equal the"}]}],"id":"blk-54940","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-54942","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105713","text":"endpoint the record declares, and "},{"id":"spn-105714","marks":["code"],"text":"_gotcha"},{"id":"spn-105715","text":" must be present — a honeypot dropped in a refactor fails silently, which is exactly what a gate is for."}]},{"id":"blk-54943","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105716","marks":["code"],"text":"/app/"},{"id":"spn-105717","text":" (the playground) is hand-authored, predates this shell, and is NOT generated. It is the surface's "},{"id":"spn-105718","marks":["code"],"text":"live_deployed"},{"id":"spn-105719","text":" artifact."}]},{"id":"blk-54944","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105720","marks":["bold"],"text":"The band says \"a specification in the ComputeDriven world\", not \"the document layer of ComputeDriven\", and that is deliberate."},{"id":"spn-105721","text":" "},{"id":"spn-105722","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand-nav"},{"id":"spn-105723","text":" records bendscript as "},{"id":"spn-105724","marks":["code"],"text":"place: 3"},{"id":"spn-105725","text":", and its own "},{"id":"spn-105726","marks":["code"],"text":"renderPlacement()"},{"id":"spn-105727","text":" gives the layer sentence to "},{"id":"spn-105728","marks":["code"],"text":"place: 2"},{"id":"spn-105729","text":" only."}]},{"id":"blk-54945","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-105730","text":"Build (the library)"}]},{"id":"blk-54946","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"npm install\nnpm test            # run all unit tests (vitest)\nnpm run typecheck   # tsc --noEmit"},{"id":"blk-54947","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105731","text":"Reference framework: "},{"id":"spn-105732","marks":["code"],"text":"@bendscript/core"},{"id":"spn-105733","text":" (TypeScript, Node 20+)."}]},{"id":"blk-54948","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54950","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105734","marks":["code"],"text":"src/types.ts"},{"id":"spn-105735","text":" — Document, Block, Span, Edge, Mark types"}]}],"id":"blk-54949","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54952","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105736","marks":["code"],"text":"src/parse.ts"},{"id":"spn-105737","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-105738","marks":["code"],"text":"parse(text) → Document"},{"id":"spn-105739","text":", "},{"id":"spn-105740","marks":["code"],"text":"normalize(doc)"},{"id":"spn-105741","text":" (link-mark expansion), "},{"id":"spn-105742","marks":["code"],"text":"parseAndNormalize"}]}],"id":"blk-54951","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54954","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105743","marks":["code"],"text":"src/validate.ts"},{"id":"spn-105744","text":" — structural validator per §2/§3 (throws "},{"id":"spn-105745","marks":["code"],"text":"ValidationError"},{"id":"spn-105746","text":" with JSON path)"}]}],"id":"blk-54953","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54956","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105747","marks":["code"],"text":"src/canonicalize.ts"},{"id":"spn-105748","text":" — RFC 8785 (JCS) wrapper for canonical serialization"}]}],"id":"blk-54955","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54958","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105749","marks":["code"],"text":"src/hash.ts"},{"id":"spn-105750","text":" — content-addressable document id ("},{"id":"spn-105751","marks":["code"],"text":"computeDocumentId"},{"id":"spn-105752","text":") using sha2-256 + json multicodec → CIDv1 multibase string"}]}],"id":"blk-54957","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54960","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105753","marks":["code"],"text":"src/expand-marks.ts"},{"id":"spn-105754","text":" — §2.5.1 link-mark → edge expansion (idempotent, dedup'd)"}]}],"id":"blk-54959","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54962","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105755","marks":["code"],"text":"src/serialize.ts"},{"id":"spn-105756","text":" — pretty-print and canonical serializers"}]}],"id":"blk-54961","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-54963","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105757","marks":["code"],"text":"test/round-trip.test.ts"},{"id":"spn-105758","text":" exercises the §8.1.1 strict round-trip claim against "},{"id":"spn-105759","marks":["code"],"text":"test-corpus/v0.1/*.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-105760","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-54964","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-105761","text":"Verification status"}]},{"id":"blk-54965","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105762","marks":["bold"],"text":"§8.1.1 parser round-trip — verified."},{"id":"spn-105763","text":" 96 tests passing as of 2026-04-27 against the full 20-document corpus:"}]},{"id":"blk-54966","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54968","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105764","marks":["code"],"text":"parse(serialize(parse(d))) === parse(d)"},{"id":"spn-105765","text":" holds for all 20 corpus documents (Unicode, ZWJ emoji, deeply nested lists, all five reserved vocabularies, supersedes/tombstones, untyped links)"}]}],"id":"blk-54967","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54970","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105766","text":"Document id is stable across parse/serialize cycles"}]}],"id":"blk-54969","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54972","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105767","text":"Editing span text changes the id; editing "},{"id":"spn-105768","marks":["code"],"text":"meta"},{"id":"spn-105769","text":" does NOT (§5.1 trade-off works as designed)"}]}],"id":"blk-54971","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54974","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105770","text":"RFC 8785 canonicalization is field-order independent"}]}],"id":"blk-54973","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54976","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105771","text":"Link-mark expansion is deterministic and idempotent"}]}],"id":"blk-54975","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54978","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105772","text":"Untyped link marks (no "},{"id":"spn-105773","marks":["code"],"text":"predicate"},{"id":"spn-105774","text":") do NOT emit edges (per §2.5.1)"}]}],"id":"blk-54977","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-54979","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105775","marks":["bold"],"text":"§8 harness mechanics — verified with mock LLMs."},{"id":"spn-105776","text":" No paid API calls yet:"}]},{"id":"blk-54980","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54982","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105777","text":"Drift metric implemented (5 components per §8.4: block_structure, edge_preservation, span_coverage, mark_fidelity, vocabulary_integrity), zero-drift on identical docs"}]}],"id":"blk-54981","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54984","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105778","text":"Identity / small-edit / lossy / garbage mock models exercise each failure mode"}]}],"id":"blk-54983","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54986","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105779","text":"Median + P95 aggregation per §8.5"}]}],"id":"blk-54985","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54988","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105780","text":"Threshold checking emits "},{"id":"spn-105781","marks":["code"],"text":"pass"},{"id":"spn-105782","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-105783","marks":["code"],"text":"fail"},{"id":"spn-105784","text":" verdict with failing thresholds enumerated"}]}],"id":"blk-54987","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54990","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105785","marks":["code"],"text":"MockModel"},{"id":"spn-105786","text":" with "},{"id":"spn-105787","marks":["code"],"text":"lossy"},{"id":"spn-105788","text":" mode confirmed: harness correctly enforces spec invariant that link-mark edges always re-expand on parse, so dropping the "},{"id":"spn-105789","marks":["code"],"text":"edges"},{"id":"spn-105790","text":" array doesn't lose link-mark-derived edges"}]}],"id":"blk-54989","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-54991","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105791","marks":["bold"],"text":"§8.1.2 LLM round-trip — not yet run against real models."},{"id":"spn-105792","text":" Implementing a "},{"id":"spn-105793","marks":["code"],"text":"ModelClient"},{"id":"spn-105794","text":" against OpenRouter is the next step. Estimated cost: $5–20 per gating run (180 calls = 20 docs × 3 classes × 3 models)."}]},{"id":"blk-54992","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105795","marks":["bold"],"text":"§14.3.1 Graphonomous adoption — not yet implemented."},{"id":"spn-105796","text":" This is the other gating commitment for v0.1 final."}]},{"id":"blk-54993","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-105797","text":"Conventions"}]},{"id":"blk-54994","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54996","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105798","text":"Spec uses RFC discipline (MUST / SHOULD / MAY)"}]}],"id":"blk-54995","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-54998","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105799","text":"Canonical document form is JSON; text projection deferred to v0.2"}]}],"id":"blk-54997","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55000","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105800","marks":["code"],"text":".bend"},{"id":"spn-105801","text":" files are not hand-authored — produced by editors that emit JSON"}]}],"id":"blk-54999","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55002","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-105802","text":"No host coupling: the protocol must work in TypeScript, Elixir, Rust, plain HTML"}]}],"id":"blk-55001","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraz27nqubgwqy75lithbe2z37ds2wmn3fdcsf4s5mwakb7mslxrppa","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}